@startuml CardioRisk_Arquitetura
title Arquitetura — CardioRisk Periop

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F8FA
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam component {
  BorderColor       #1A6BF0
  BackgroundColor   #EBF1FE
  FontColor         #0D1117
}

skinparam database {
  BorderColor       #C47A00
  BackgroundColor   #FFF8E6
}

skinparam ArrowColor  #555555
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

[Mobile App\n(React Native / Expo)]        as mobile    #EDF0F5
[Frontend Web\n(React + Vite)]             as frontend  #EBF1FE
[Backend API\n(FastAPI)]                   as api       #EDFAF4
[Motor de Cálculo\n(RCRI / VSG)]           as calc      #EDFAF4
[Analisador de Texto Clínico\n(regras + NER opcional)] as nlp #EDFAF4
[Modelo NER local\n(opcional)]             as ner       #FFF8E6
database "LocalStorage\n(navegador)"       as ls        #FFF8E6

mobile    --> frontend : carrega via WebView
frontend  --> api      : HTTP REST\n(/calculate, /nlp/analyze)
frontend  --> ls       : salva sessão
api       --> calc     : calcula risco
api       --> nlp      : extrai dados do texto
nlp       --> ner      : inferência local\n(sem chamada externa)

@enduml
